                    <Pad Id="UtNfXJRgFEHMjXUFYic5Ga" Bounds="837,334,286,123" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="These are different states, each of them is doing something different, but from the main patch they are interchangeble, because they comply to the same Interface. Each of the states can switch itself to (exchange itself with) another state.">
